ble-universe/lean/QOU/KZ/FuchsianParam.lean#L303-L316","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KZ.FuchsianParam.boundedOn_coeff","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KZ.FuchsianParam.boundedOn_coeff","kind":"theorem","line":296,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KZ/FuchsianParam.lean#L296-L300","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KZ.FuchsianParam.exists_weighted_bound","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KZ.FuchsianParam.exists_weighted_bound","kind":"theorem","line":288,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KZ/FuchsianParam.lean#L288-L293","doc":"The uniform weighted bound, in the form `∃ D, …`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KZ.FuchsianParam.exists_uniform_bound","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KZ.FuchsianParam.exists_uniform_bound","kind":"theorem","line":273,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KZ/FuchsianParam.lean#L273-L286","doc":"**Uniform weighted bound** `‖H_k(s)‖ r^k ≤ D` for all `s ∈ U`, all `k`, with `D ≥ 0`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KZ.FuchsianParam.exists_bound_le","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KZ.FuchsianParam.exists_bound_le","kind":"theorem","line":250,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KZ/FuchsianParam.lean#L250-L271","doc":"Finitely many coefficients are bounded uniformly in the parameter. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KZ.FuchsianParam.weighted_le_of_initial","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KZ.FuchsianParam.weighted_le_of_initial","kind":"theorem","line":193,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KZ/FuchsianParam.lean#L193-L246","doc":"**Majorant step with a prescribed bound** (variant of `bounded_weighted`): beyond the\nthreshold `k₁`, the weighted coefficients never exceed a bound `D` valid below `k₁`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KZ.FuchsianParam.differentiableOn_coeff","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KZ.FuchsianParam.differentiableOn_coeff","kind":"theorem","line":170,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KZ/FuchsianParam.lean#L170-L185","doc":"**Holomorphy of the coefficients in the parameter.** ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KZ.FuchsianParam.coeff_rec","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KZ.FuchsianParam.coeff_rec","kind":"theorem","line":157,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KZ/FuchsianParam.lean#L157-L168","doc":"The recursion for the coefficients through the continuous inverse. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KZ.FuchsianParam.indInv_indicial","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KZ.FuchsianParam.indInv_indicial","kind":"theorem","line":150,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KZ/FuchsianParam.lean#L150-L153","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KZ.FuchsianParam.indInv","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KZ.FuchsianParam.indInv","kind":"def","line":139,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KZ/FuchsianParam.lean#L139-L148","doc":"The continuous inverse of the indicial operator (open mapping theorem). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KZ.FuchsianParam.indicialCLM_apply","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KZ.FuchsianParam.indicialCLM_apply","kind":"theorem","line":136,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41