cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KZ/FuchsianParam.lean#L60-L76","doc":"**Commutation**: an element commuting with every coefficient of `M` commutes with every\ncoefficient of the normalised formal solution. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KZ.FuchsianParam.indicial_ad_comm","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KZ.FuchsianParam.indicial_ad_comm","kind":"theorem","line":50,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KZ/FuchsianParam.lean#L50-L58","doc":"The indicial operator intertwines `ad_c` whenever `c` commutes with the residue. ","signatureChunk":0}]}